                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>100 feet.</p>\n<p>The warsworn automatically controls unattended weapons in the aura, which levitate around the warsworn. The warsworn can telekinetically wield these weapons to make melee Strikes with a reach of 100 feet. These strikes deal five of the weapon's damage dice +15 and use the weapon's damage type.</p>"
