                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A creature hit by a serpentsworn's hurled remains Strike must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:42|options:inflicts:prone] save. On a failure, the target falls @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone]; if the target was airborne, it falls up to 120 feet, taking damage from the fall and landing prone if the descent brings it to the ground. On a critical failure, the target is also trapped under a pile of bones and miscellaneous detritus ([[/act escape dc=42]]).</p>"
                },
