                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The serpentsworn can simultaneously keep as many creatures @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained] in its coils as will fit in its space. It can move normally with one or more creatures grabbed or restrained, carrying them along with it.</p>"
